xabe̱la dxegu'e̱ lue' zrul-la.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Quebe guzezxe gubizra lue' te zra,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ne quebe bi gune beu' lue' chizrela.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Xranu' Dios guxúequeze̱' lue' chee̱ quebe bi da cale̱la","poem":1},{"text":"gaca na chiu'.","poem":2},{"text":"Guxúequeze̱' bénne'du xu'u.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Xránadxu Dios guxúequeze̱' lue' gate dxedxúaju',","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ne gate dxexú'u, na'a zra, ne chadía chacanna.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/zat_wbt/PSA/121.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/zat_wbt/PSA/122.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/zat_wbt/PSA/120.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}